    "Anya stayed in the bathroom until the hallway filled up."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:591
translate english c56a57ce:

    # "Iris trouvera un moyen de la faire ressortir sans attirer l’attention."
    "Iris will find a way to get her out without drawing attention."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:593
translate english cceffe80:

    # think "Anya. Au moins, elle sait où elle est maintenant."
    think "Anya. At least she knows where she is now."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:595
translate english 5b209d40:

    # "Je repense à son histoire."
    "I think back on her story."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:597
translate english e2c664e0:

    # think "Un an bloquée à Limen, et tout ça pour finir dans un conteneur qui n’est même pas arrivé à Nexus."
    think "A year stuck in Limen, and all of it to end up in a container that didn't even make it to Nexus."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:599
translate english 6940725f:

    # "Je regarde machinalement les caméras du couloir."
    "I glance at the hallway cameras out of habit."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:601
