    think "The worst part is that she got lucky: a different destination, a few degrees colder, a few more hours..."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:603
translate english faa53307:

    # "Je préfère ne pas terminer cette pensée."
    "I'd rather not finish that thought."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:615
