    mara reflexion "Because every time somebody says that sentence, Kami finds a way to prove them wrong."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:636
translate english 72d951c8:

    # elen sourire "Moi ça me paraît plutôt logique de l’autoriser."
    elen sourire "Honestly it seems pretty logical to me to allow it."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:638
