    julian taquin "Technically, right now there are four of us in the same hallway. What a scandal."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:644
translate english 6440f2bb:

    # mara "La règle vise surtout les rassemblements organisés."
    mara "The rule is mostly aimed at organized gatherings."

