    # "La conversation continue encore quelques minutes. Personne ne semble particulièrement inquiet et, après les derniers votes, ça fait presque étrange."
    "The conversation goes on a few more minutes. Nobody seems particularly worried and, after the last few votes, that feels almost strange."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:680
