    # think "Ça change. J’en viens presque à oublier qu’une fille clandestine dort dans la chambre d’Iris."
    think "That's a change. I almost start forgetting there's an illegal girl sleeping in Iris's room."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:735
translate english a3a2b2bf:

    # think "Presque."
    think "Almost."

