    "Then I pull my hand back."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:832
translate english 2aeb9f58:

    # think "Non, pas maintenant. Si Ryn a découvert Anya, il faut réfléchir avant de faire quoi que ce soit."
    think "No, not now. If Ryn found out about Anya, we need to think before doing anything."

# game/scenario/8_1_0_0.rpy:834
